# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for "Beyond Binary Churn"
#
# The repository intentionally COMMITS the small run-level result tables
# (KKBoxData/*.csv, KKBoxData/*.json), the tuning sweeps (KKBoxData/sweeps/*),
# the paired-test outputs (outputs/statistics/*) and the final figures
# (FinalPlots/*.png) so that the statistical analysis can be verified without
# rerunning the pipeline.
#
# It EXCLUDES the large raw data, the engineered panels, the sequence caches
# and every trained model / probability dump. Those are regenerated from the
# raw Kaggle download via the scripts and notebooks (see README).
# Do NOT add a blanket "*.csv" / "*.json" rule here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Raw data (download from Kaggle; convert with prepare_raw_data.py) ---
KKBoxData/RawData/*.csv
KKBoxData/RawData/*.parquet
KKBoxData/RawData/*.7z
KKBoxData/RawData/*.zip

# --- Engineered panels & true-cutoff feature caches (regenerated) ---
KKBoxData/*.parquet

# --- Sequence tensors / caches (regenerated by Classify_03) ---
KKBoxData/seq_cache/
KKBoxData/*.npy

# --- Trained models & probability dumps (regenerated; not versioned) ---
KKBoxData/*.pt
KKBoxData/*.joblib
KKBoxData/*.pkl

# --- Historical scratch space ---
KKBoxData/old_files/

# --- Gradient-boosting training logs ---
catboost_info/

# --- Python / Jupyter housekeeping ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
